  "adaptations": [
    "Complete entered-key/backspace/era/day-period/number bounds/restart/auto-next and relevant spinbutton keyboard algorithms operate on native-owned pinned field state",
    "Use native original keyboard event data and explicit actual-focus callbacks; group RTL movement requires current native physical geometry",
    "Replace DOM text/content/selection writes with separate owned SDK input admission; no existing editor writes, no replay",
    "Retain pinned display-name Intl fallback and every date-field translation; installed native semantics/IME/default/focus/geometry remain unqualified"
  ],
  "approval": "Complete roadmap3.5.52 directly approved2026-10-22",
  "verification": "35 actual canonical TimePicker entry/key/name/empty-value oracles;77 native source cases across five suites, with final19 entry cases repeated after metadata additions; focused oracle types773files/zero diagnostics. No native event/controller adoption or installed IME/default/focus/geometry verdict.",
